WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.475 --> 00:00:03.388
建立控制帧演示连接 / Open the control-frame example connection

2
00:00:03.388 --> 00:00:06.430
选中本轮连接 / Select this connection

3
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.375
打开Messages / Open Messages

4
00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:12.326
打开连接断点设置 / Open connection breakpoint settings

5
00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:15.225
选择Both方向 / Select Both directions

6
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:18.178
增加ping帧 / Include ping frames

7
00:00:18.178 --> 00:00:21.224
增加pong帧 / Include pong frames

8
00:00:21.224 --> 00:00:24.175
启用Both消息与ping/pong / Enable Both message and ping/pong breakpoints

9
00:00:24.175 --> 00:00:27.325
发送非空消息并暂停 / Send and pause a non-empty message

10
00:00:27.325 --> 00:00:30.334
选择Text替换 / Choose Text replacement

11
00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:33.264
明确填写空Text / Explicitly leave Text empty

12
00:00:33.264 --> 00:00:36.281
发送空消息而不是保留原文 / Forward an empty message instead of keeping the original

13
00:00:36.281 --> 00:00:39.279
放行Both中的返回方向 / Continue the return direction in Both mode

14
00:00:39.279 --> 00:00:42.381
发送guide-ping并暂停 / Send and pause guide-ping

15
00:00:42.381 --> 00:00:45.479
原样放行ping / Continue ping unchanged

16
00:00:45.479 --> 00:00:48.480
原样放行返回pong / Continue the returning pong unchanged

17
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.430
停用本轮Both设置 / Disable the current Both settings

18
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.389
重新打开连接设置 / Open connection settings again

19
00:00:54.389 --> 00:00:57.343
关闭演示只选择Sent / Select Sent for the close example

20
00:00:57.343 --> 00:01:00.330
不再暂停message / Stop pausing message

21
00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.283
不再暂停ping / Stop pausing ping

22
00:01:03.283 --> 00:01:06.230
不再暂停pong / Stop pausing pong

23
00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.233
选择close控制帧 / Select close control frames

24
00:01:09.233 --> 00:01:12.183
启用Sent close断点 / Enable the Sent close breakpoint

25
00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:15.279
客户端请求以1000关闭 / Ask the client to close with code 1000

26
00:01:15.279 --> 00:01:18.282
只将关闭码改为1001 / Change only the close code to 1001

27
00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:21.236
核对源站修改和客户端实际关闭确认 / Verify the origin edit and the actual client close acknowledgement
